bankers of integrity, honest and hard-working mechanics, doctors and men of all professions, leaders in their communities, ministers and devout church workers, in fact, men and women from every walk of life. Today, Kokomo made, may well boast that she has royally entertained the biggest crowd of 100% red-blooded Americans

