Clark, the PR man, is now the acting imperial wizard, but he needs allies to run the clan. And his chief ally is the head of the clan's secretariat, who is called Hiram Wesley Evans. So we've met him before, haven't we? He's popping up all over the place, giving rants, mad rants, I mentioned Stalin and I said he was the head of the clan's secretariat and people who know

